#. type: Title #
#: docs/features/goal.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Session Goal（会话目标）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/goal.md:8
msgid ""
"Session Goal 允许为单个会话设定持久目标。每轮对话结束后，独立的 **judge 模型"
"**判定目标是否完成；未完成则自动注入续跑提示，驱动 agent 继续工作，直到目标达"
"成、turn 预算耗尽、或被用户暂停/清除。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/goal.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "命令"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/goal.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 命令                  | 说明                                         |\n"
"| --------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `/goal <描述>`        | 设定目标并开始首轮执行（默认 20 turn 预算）  |\n"
"| `/goal status`        | 查看当前目标、子目标、turn 计数与 judge 理由 |\n"
"| `/goal pause`         | 暂停自动续跑（保留目标状态）                 |\n"
"| `/goal resume`        | 恢复自动续跑                                 |\n"
"| `/goal clear`         | 清除目标                                     |\n"
"| `/subgoal`            | 列出子目标                                   |\n"
"| `/subgoal <条件>`     | 追加子条件                                   |\n"
"| `/subgoal remove <N>` | 删除第 N 条子目标（1-based）                 |\n"
"| `/subgoal clear`      | 清空子目标                                   |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/goal.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "工作流程"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/features/goal.md:31
msgid "用户执行 `/goal …` → 写入 `conversations.goal` 并触发 engine run。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/features/goal.md:31
msgid ""
"每轮 assistant 回复结束 → **goal judge** 读取目标、子目标、最近对话与末轮回"
"复。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/features/goal.md:31
msgid "Judge 输出严格 JSON：`{\"done\": boolean, \"reason\": \"...\"}`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/features/goal.md:31
msgid ""
"`done: false` → 注入 user-role 续跑消息（如 `↻ Continuing toward goal "
"(3/20): …`），在同一 SSE 流内继续下一轮。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/features/goal.md:31
msgid "`done: true` → 标记 completed，停止续跑。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: docs/features/goal.md:31
msgid ""
"用户中途发消息会 preempt 当前续跑；该轮结束后重新 judge，未 pause 则继续。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/goal.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Judge 保守策略"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/goal.md:37
msgid ""
"**通过**：assistant 明确确认完成、清楚展示最终产出、或说明不可达成/需用户输入"
"（reason 说明阻塞点）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/goal.md:37
msgid "**不通过**：模糊进展、仅有计划无证据、「暗示已完成」不算。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/goal.md:37
msgid ""
"**Fail-open**：judge 调用或解析失败时视为未完成，靠 turn 预算兜底，避免卡死。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/goal.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "配置"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/goal.md:41
msgid ""
"在 `~/.anima/config.yaml` 的 `llm.profiles` 中可选配置 `goal_judge`（见 "
"[`config.example.yaml`](../../config.example.yaml)）。未配置时回退 "
"`llm.default_profile`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/goal.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "与 ACP 的区别"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/goal.md:46
msgid "**Goal**：同会话内同步续跑循环，由 platform turn 生命周期编排。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/goal.md:46
msgid "**ACP**：外部 agent 异步任务，完成后通过 callback 触发独立 turn。"
msgstr ""

